keywords:
  - microlensing
  - Roman Space Telescope
  - astrophysics
  - astronomical archives
  - time-domain astronomy
abstract: >
  RomanMAST is a community proposal outlining three archival datasets
  designed to enhance Roman Space Telescope microlensing science.
  The project focuses on enabling joint analysis between Roman observations
  and historical datasets including OGLE, Gaia, Spitzer, and KMTNet.
